  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. In a medium saucepan, add the boiling water (see ingredients). <br>• Add basmati rice, chicken stock and currants. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat. <br>• Keep covered until rice is tender and all water is absorbed, 10 minutes.</p> <p>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185cc80e0f84c774d3c1d/step-69acdc00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the rice has 10 minutes remaining, thinly slice tomato and cucumber into rounds.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185cc80e0f84c774d3c1d/step-35c2e410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, a drizzle of honey, tossing to coat. <br>• Transfer to a plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185cc80e0f84c774d3c1d/step-5222f620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken. <br>• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine tomato, cucumber and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season. <br>• Stir through baby spinach leaves through the rice, until combined. <br>• Divide currant rice and cucumber-tomato salsa between bowls. Top with chermoula plant-based crumbed chicken. <br>• Serve with garlic sauce. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185cc80e0f84c774d3c1d/step-03f8a730.jpg"
    }
  ]
